{"id":"steam-4004820","steam":4004820,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"FreeStyle Football 2","summary":"Freestyle Football 2 is a fast-paced, 5v5 match-based online multiplayer soccer game.\r\nEach position has a unique role, and you'll utilize a variety of strategies and skills to achieve victory with your team.\r\nStylish play and unique characters transform the pitch into a stage.","about":"Freestyle Football 2 is an online multiplayer soccer game featuring 5v5 matches with unique character roles and skills. \n\nPlay Your Own Style\n\nFreestyle Football 2 is an online multiplayer football game that combines fast-paced matches, flashy individual skills, and team play.\n\n \n\nEach position has a unique role. Use a variety of strategies and skills to claim victory with your team.\n\n \n\nStylish moves and distinctive characters turn the field into a stage.\n\nTeam Play Powered by Skills\n\nFreestyle Football 2 is an online multiplayer football game that combines fast-paced matches, flashy individual skills, and team play.\n\n \n\nEach position has a unique role. Use a variety of strategies and skills to claim victory with your team.\n\n \n\nStylish moves and distinctive characters turn the field into a stage.\n\nStrategic Formations\n\nThere’s more than one way to win.\n\n \n\nPush forward with an aggressive formation to pressure your opponents, or sit back with a solid defense and strike on the counter.\n\n \n\nTake on different roles with your teammates, adapt your strategy to the flow of the match, and experience true team play.\n\nArenas Full of Character\n\nFrom fields set in the heart of the city to fields set against iconic landmarks around the world, every map offers a different atmosphere.\n\n \n\nEach map isn’t just a backdrop.\n\nMake It Your Moment\n\nScoring a goal is the biggest thrill in the game.\n\n \n\nExpress your team’s victory with a unique celebration and make the moment yours.\n\n \n\nCap off the match highlight with a stylish performance.\n\nEvery Character Has a Story\n\nEach character in Freestyle Football 2 has their own background and personality.\n\n \n\nMeet a diverse cast, learn their stories, and dive deeper into the world of Freestyle Football 2.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/405c9ccbef4224fa52954a7062f0ce0ff46ef95c/library_capsule.jpg?t=1792979830","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/0e131f5e9ca2918c342e8c8679341fee49b1b75e/header.jpg?t=1792979830","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/0d196b1ff73b39fbe4f226c13c95bcee5fc17c86/library_hero.jpg?t=1792979830","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/0e131f5e9ca2918c342e8c8679341fee49b1b75e/header.jpg?t=1792979830","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/c27e1e9fee0f2f26c9d82bc01a09859033f9ea81/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1792979830","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/da089f149d5aa360be32c20e1dde184cd57a5966/ss_da089f149d5aa360be32c20e1dde184cd57a5966.600x338.jpg?t=1792979830","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/da089f149d5aa360be32c20e1dde184cd57a5966/ss_da089f149d5aa360be32c20e1dde184cd57a5966.jpg?t=1792979830"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/f6a44b790ba20ac9ddf4e991134cf6dc82f7ea85/ss_f6a44b790ba20ac9ddf4e991134cf6dc82f7ea85.600x338.jpg?t=1792979830","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/f6a44b790ba20ac9ddf4e991134cf6dc82f7ea85/ss_f6a44b790ba20ac9ddf4e991134cf6dc82f7ea85.jpg?t=1792979830"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004820/48918c3a6de4e893e5d3c24739bf82179f41d592/ss_48918c3a6de4e893e5d3c24739bf82179f41d592.600x338.jpg?t=1792979830","full":"https://s